OL,3,GNEWSAConfidential agreement aims to
OL,4,Aboost house building
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn agreement has been reached between
OL,7,Fcouncillors and the government with the
OL,8,Faim of building thousands of homes.
OL,10,FCornwall Council said it had signed a
OL,11,Fconfidential memorandum of
OL,12,Funderstanding (MoU) with Homes England
OL,13,Fto secure more funding for new housing.
OL,15,FThe council is the third local
OL,16,Fauthority to enter an agreement with
OL,17,Fthe organisation after Housing Minister
OL,18,FMatthew Pennycook supported Cornwall's
OL,19,Fhousing prospectus, which has a goal of
OL,20,Fbuilding 4,421 homes every year.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
