OL,3,GNEWSAConfidential agreement aims to
OL,4,Aboost house building
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,7,Fsaid opposition councillors were
OL,8,Fcritical of the MoU details not being
OL,9,Fmade public, but Peter La Broy -
OL,10,Fportfolio holder for housing - said
OL,11,FHomes England "asked for
OL,12,Fconfidentiality".
